  "contentHtml": "<p>\r\n<table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"100\" height=\"30\" align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/relay/cafe/original/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fsedu21.com%2Fimages%2Fbrd_title.gif\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"1\" bgcolor=\"#ededed\"></td>\r\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"9\">멘델 동물 만들기</td></tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"100\" height=\"1\" bgcolor=\"#e7e7e7\" colspan=\"11\"></td></tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"100\" height=\"30\" align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/relay/cafe/original/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fsedu21.com%2Fimages%2Fbrd_name.gif\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"1\" bgcolor=\"#ededed\"></td>\r\n<td align=\"center\">김영학</td>\r\n<td width=\"1\" bgcolor=\"#ededed\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"100\" height=\"30\" align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/relay/cafe/original/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fsedu21.com%2Fimages%2Fbrd_date.gif\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"1\" bgcolor=\"#ededed\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"100\" align=\"center\">2010-10-02</td></tr></tbody></table><p><br></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>간단한 동물을 만들고 멘델의 유전법칙을 탐구하는 활동입니다.</p>\r\n<p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/992E193359B245A01C\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"703\" height=\"512\" style=\"width: 703px; height: 512px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"p9ZpLa14eLma.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\"  id=\"A_992E193359B245A01CF332\"/></p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DAM6%26dataid%3D42%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20140119162701&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile270.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F99B98D3359B232284023F4')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> reebops activity.pdf</a></p><p><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0px; width: 100%;\"><a class=\"imageUtil\" id=\"thumb_047478426131596923\" href=\"http://www.sedu21.com/UpLoadIMG/p9ZpLa14eLma.jpg\"><img class=\"chimg_photo\" id=\"image_047478426131596923\" style=\"width: 452px; height: 348px;\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/relay/cafe/original/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.sedu21.com%2FUpLoadIMG%2Fp9ZpLa14eLma.jpg\" border=\"0\"></a></p>\r\n<p><br>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><br><img style=\"vertical-align: middle;\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/relay/cafe/original/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fsedu21.com%2Fadmin%2Fboard%2Fcheditor%2F%2Ficons%2Fem%2F21.gif\" border=\"0\"> 이 동물을 유전학 수업에 어떻게 활용할 수 있을까요?<br>선생님들의 상상력 풍부한 아이디어를 기다리겠습니다!<br></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"70%\" height=\"25\">미국 수업시간에는 색깔이 있는 종이를 많이 쓴다는 것이 우리나라와 다르더군요 학생들을 잠시도 가만히 놓아두지 않고 또한 학생들도 잠시도 가만히 있지 않고 조사해온내용을 항상 손을 들고 발표하려고 하는것이 수업시간에 다른짓을 할수 없도록 만듭니다 간단한활동으로도 엄마와 아버지를 자식들이 닮는다는것을 알수 있을것 같아요 </td>\r\n<td width=\"15%\" align=\"right\">[ 한선옥 ]</td>\r\n<td width=\"10%\" align=\"right\">2010-10-02</td></tr></tbody></table><p><br></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
